MapIntro:01
"Welcome To Ring Wars created by I_Show_No_Mercy     Now map edited by SilverBane on 29.11.2013"
End

MapIntro:02
"Please pay attention I am going to list all the things you need to know!"
End

MapIntro:03
"The Beacons tell you where your adventure begins build the unit that you would like to spawn and the unit will appear in front of your fortress."
End

MapIntro:04
"These beacons represent to unique units. If you move a unit to the square with the number, and have that number of resources (in thousands) the unit will be created. There is no limit to how many you can create."
End

MapIntro:05
"Make Sure you activate your ring power scavenger or you WILL NOT get money you have to fight to get money."
End

MapIntro:06
"The better the units are, the slower they will spawn so keep that in mind."
End

MapIntro:07
"Be Careful how many Fortresses you build you only have to lose one to be defeated"
End

MapIntro:08
"If you want to play a regular map you must restart the program to avoid out of syncs."
End

MapIntro:09
"Make sure you restart the game if you plan to play a map other than Ring Wars or any game you play WILL go OUT OF SYNC!! press the X on the box if you plan to restart the program."
End

MapIntro:10
"Another Reminder DONT FORGET TO RESTART THE GAME IF YOU PLAN TO PLAY A DIFFERENT MAP!!!"
End

Changes In 1.04uo
"In this version drogoth is now 15,000 and grond 20,000 and you may now buy the balrog for 40,000 and he has no timer and also note that I didnt make the ini file or the map they were made by I_Show_No_Mercy,I just edited a small part of them!"
End

